39782477", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823485_1415358243115810_7767185752610860171_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GRuGeMl9YpYQ7kNvwFHfuux&_nc_oc=Adpg8IUR-mSgTx12wLVFoAHv8uLJq_hc03XFlPaFpXPnjkmEWB6O8mnKKK3mzP87v88&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_y50WBEo-sh6uP8vODNqysHHSWWLQZ-dellrROfAI2Gg&oe=6A394E37"}, {"file_name": "untitled.png", "id": "24979304018336283", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499299808_24979304025002949_1358537660123093337_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=I8z01uMoIf0Q7kNvwHfXSsu&_nc_oc=AdpxR8xKgVq2gTeHkFKFBqCR15ifVH0hGEJJve_cBZmh2iJR-TdNxSx_pvhTWYSK0eU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_ZatAnfoNtdv3EpeFcKpmjItpdgs5HrcvBbvjgstBf6A&oe=6A395979"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "John's Basics", "keywords": ["Horror", "BaldiBasics", "Multiplayer", "Baldi", "Basics"], "long_description": "# **John\u2019s Basics**\n\n**John\u2019s Basics** is a chilling VR horror experience inspired by the classic *Baldi\u2019s Basics*.\n\nStep into twisted classrooms, solve brain-bending puzzles, and try to stay one step ahead of **John**\u2014a relentless threat in a warped school that feeds on your mistakes.\n\nThe deeper you go, the darker it gets.\n\nWith eerie soundscapes, sudden scares, and a constant feeling of being watched, **John\u2019s Basics** doesn\u2019t just test your wits\u2014it plays with your sanity.\n\n---\n\n**Think you\u2019re smart enough to survive school?**  \n**Prove it.**\n", "short_description": "A twisted VR horror-lite experience inspired by Baldi\u2019s Basics\u2014where learning gets unsettling."}]}, "developer_name": "Mythborn Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://johns-learning.co.uk/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://johns-learning.co.uk/tos", "publisher_name": "Mythborn Games", "support_website_url": nul